# Luigi's Box
> Luigi's Box is a search-and-discovery platform providing AI-powered site search, product recommendations, product listing pages, merchandising, shopping assistant, and a conversational shopping agent for e-commerce websites. Used by 4,000+ online stores to improve product discovery and increase conversions.


