## Products
- [AI Search](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/search/) - Full-text site search with autocomplete, typo correction, synonym detection, and personalized ranking
- [Recommender](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/recommender/) - Personalized product recommendations based on shopper behavior and preferences
- [Product Listing](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/product-listing/) - Automated category and brand page arrangement based on popularity, margin, and other business rules
- [Analytics](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/analytics/) - Tracking and reporting on on-site search and browsing behavior
- [Shopping Assistant](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/shopping-assistant/) - Guided, structured question-based flow that guides shoppers to a product recommendation
- [Conversational Agent](https://www.luigisbox.com/products/conversational-agent/) - Natural language chat built into search and autocomplete for conversational product discovery


